# Hazard models

- Individual-first, compound-second. No CHI without documented interaction.
- Flood PHI rainfall-threshold baseline is IMPLEMENTED (`hazards/flood/phi.py`, ADR-0006). New hazards still go through `make scaffold-hazard`.
- Version formulas (`FORMULA_VERSION`). Do not mix exposure into PHI.
